+# Timburr and Conkeldurr model credits
+
+- **Timburr**, by [nguyenlouis32](https://sketchfab.com/nguyenlouis32): https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/timburr-656b3a3464724f49905b23738de8e5d2
+- **Conkeldurr**, by [nguyenlouis32](https://sketchfab.com/nguyenlouis32): https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/conkeldurr-e3fa0c6e58e34eb5aed4fbcf7047f80f
+- Both model files embed **CC BY 4.0** attribution: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
+- Downloaded from the [Pokémon 3D API asset repository](https://github.com/Pokemon-3D-api/assets), revision `429de1288cea0d43f5b4f56305d2276e94239d65`, paths `models/opt/regular/532.glb` and `models/opt/regular/534.glb`. These optimized GLBs are included unmodified; the game changes scale, position and rotation at runtime. They contain WebP textures and Draco compression; neither contains embedded animation clips.
+- Pokémon characters are property of Nintendo / Creatures Inc. / GAME FREAK inc. The project owner states permission for their use. The model licence is attribution for the model source, not an independent grant of character rights.
+- `sources.json` records embedded attribution metadata, file sizes and SHA-256 hashes.
+- Draco decoder files are copied from the installed Three.js distribution (`three/examples/jsm/libs/draco/gltf`). Draco is Copyright Google, Inc., under Apache License 2.0; see `draco/LICENSE`.
+- Companion sound accents are original synthesized tones; no Pokémon audio is included.
